, October 23 7:30am - 12:00pm Saturday, October 24 9:00am - 3:00pm Sunday, October 25 9:00am - 3:00pm Monday, October 26 7:30am - 4:00pm Tuesday, October 27 7:30am - 6:30pm Wednesday, October 28 7:30am - 4:00pm Thursday, October 29 7:30am - 4:00pm Friday, October 30 7:30am - 12:00pm Vote in Person on Election Day Tuesday, November 3, 2026, from 7:00 am - 8:00 pm. It is highly recommended all voters  verify their precinct and polling location  before going to the polls on Election Day as some locations have recently changed. Sample Ballots Plymouth is broken up into two State Representative districts and therefore there are ballots specific to each district. Quickly  look up your precinct  to ensure you review the correct ballot! 1st Plymouth District  = Precincts 4, 6-12, 14-18 12th Plymouth District  = Precincts 1-3, 5, 13 1st District - Nov 2026 Sample (PDF ) 12th District - Nov 2026 Sample (PDF) Notifications Advance Processing of State Election Ballots Notification Ballot Testing for State Election 
     

 
